{
    "title": "Video Player All Format",
    "description": "Video Player All Format is a powerful video player and media player. <b>Free, NO Ads.</b>\r\n\r\nIt supports <b>ALL video formats</b>, plays 4k/ ultra HD / full HD videos with high definition and smoothly. Video Player All Format is the best HD video player for android tablets and phones.\r\n\r\nWith built-in <b>Private Folder</b>, you can hide personal / x videos and protects them from being deleted or seen by others.\r\n\r\nKEY FEATURES:\r\n\u25cf <b>Support ALL formats</b>, including MKV, MP4, MOV, FLV, AVI, 3GP, RMVB, M4V, WAV, WMV, TS etc.\r\n\u25cf Play 4K / HD videos smoothly with HD video player.\r\n\u25cf <b>Private Folder</b> protects your videos.\r\n\u25cf <b>Subtitle downloader</b> and custom styles.\r\n\u25cf <b>Hardware acceleration</b>.\r\n\u25cf Play video in floating/<b>pop-up window</b> or split screen.\r\n\u25cf <b>Background Play</b>.\r\n\u25cf Powerful <b>equalizer</b> to enjoy high quality audio.\r\n\u25cf Night Mode, Sleep Timer, AB Repeat, Mirror, Playback Speed.\r\n\u25cf Gesture Control to adjust volume, brightness, seek progress.\r\n\u25cf Scan and manage video files on device and SD card.\r\n\u25cf Create playlists to manage your favorite videos.\r\n\u25cf Various playback modes: auto rotation, screen aspect, screen lock.\r\n\u25cf Easy to use HD video player.\r\n\u25cf Video player all format.\r\n\r\nAll Format Video Player\r\nSupport all video formats including MKV, MP4, MOV, FLV, AVI, 3GP, RMVB, M4V, WAV, WMV, TS etc.  It's the best video player all format.\r\n\r\nFull HD Video Player\r\nSupport 4k/ ultra HD / full HD video playback, and play it with high definition. It's a totally HD video player for android.\r\n\r\nFloating Video Player\r\nPlay video in pop-up window, then you can take notes or handle other things while watching movie. It is a amazing multi-tasking tool for video playback.\r\n\r\nBackground Video Player\r\nListen to your favorite video in background while working, exercising, or even commuting. Play it just like a music player and mp3 player. \r\n\r\nMKV / FLV Video Player\r\nVideo Player All Format helps you play video formats not supported by the system video player. It's an all-in-one media player.\r\n\r\nVideo Player All Format - Arc Player is the best video player and feature-rich media player for android. Download it, play it,  and then enjoy the best HD video playback experience!\r\n\r\nYour feedback is very important to us. Feel free to reach us at arcplayer.feedback@gmail.com and share your suggestions to help us create a better video player!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Video Player All Format is a powerful video player and media player. <b>Free, NO Ads.</b><br><br>It supports <b>ALL video formats</b>, plays 4k/ ultra HD / full HD videos with high definition and smoothly. Video Player All Format is the best HD video player for android tablets and phones.<br><br>With built-in <b>Private Folder</b>, you can hide personal / x videos and protects them from being deleted or seen by others.<br><br>KEY FEATURES:<br>\u25cf <b>Support ALL formats</b>, including MKV, MP4, MOV, FLV, AVI, 3GP, RMVB, M4V, WAV, WMV, TS etc.<br>\u25cf Play 4K / HD videos smoothly with HD video player.<br>\u25cf <b>Private Folder</b> protects your videos.<br>\u25cf <b>Subtitle downloader</b> and custom styles.<br>\u25cf <b>Hardware acceleration</b>.<br>\u25cf Play video in floating/<b>pop-up window</b> or split screen.<br>\u25cf <b>Background Play</b>.<br>\u25cf Powerful <b>equalizer</b> to enjoy high quality audio.<br>\u25cf Night Mode, Sleep Timer, AB Repeat, Mirror, Playback Speed.<br>\u25cf Gesture Control to adjust volume, brightness, seek progress.<br>\u25cf Scan and manage video files on device and SD card.<br>\u25cf Create playlists to manage your favorite videos.<br>\u25cf Various playback modes: auto rotation, screen aspect, screen lock.<br>\u25cf Easy to use HD video player.<br>\u25cf Video player all format.<br><br>All Format Video Player<br>Support all video formats including MKV, MP4, MOV, FLV, AVI, 3GP, RMVB, M4V, WAV, WMV, TS etc.  It&#39;s the best video player all format.<br><br>Full HD Video Player<br>Support 4k/ ultra HD / full HD video playback, and play it with high definition. It&#39;s a totally HD video player for android.<br><br>Floating Video Player<br>Play video in pop-up window, then you can take notes or handle other things while watching movie. It is a amazing multi-tasking tool for video playback.<br><br>Background Video Player<br>Listen to your favorite video in background while working, exercising, or even commuting. Play it just like a music player and mp3 player. <br><br>MKV / FLV Video Player<br>Video Player All Format helps you play video formats not supported by the system video player. It&#39;s an all-in-one media player.<br><br>Video Player All Format - Arc Player is the best video player and feature-rich media player for android. Download it, play it,  and then enjoy the best HD video playback experience!<br><br>Your feedback is very important to us. Feel free to reach us at arcplayer.feedback@gmail.com and share your suggestions to help us create a better video player!",
